From {{inh|en|enm|teye|id=cord|t=cord, chain}}, from {{inh|en|ang|tēag|id=cord}}, {{m|ang|tēah|t=cord, chain}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*taugu}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*taugō}}, ultimately from {{der|en|ine-pro|*dewk-}}. Compare {{cog|da|tov}}, {{cog|is|taug}}.

