#* {{quote-book|en|year=1861|title=Mountain Charley|author=E. J. Guerin|page=20|text="Here's at you old hoss!" hiccupped I, with a friendly pitch in the way of a nod at Rice.<br>"Go it, young grampus, that's me! Here's '''till''' ye, my infant progidy!" replied he, as he clinked his glass against mine.}}
