From {{der|en|frm|théorème}}, from {{der|en|la-lat|theōrēma}}, from {{der|en|grc|θεώρημα||speculation, proposition to be proved}} (Euclid), from {{m|grc|θεωρέω||to look at, view, consider, examine}}, from {{m|grc|θεωρός||spectator}}, from {{m|grc|θέα||a view}} + {{m|grc|ὁράω||to see, look}}. See also {{m|en|theory}}, and {{m|en|theater}}.

